@id: cap:gdpr-privacy
@stratum: L1
@uses: @marketplace/eu-gdpr-privacy-safe@3.1.0
@tag: pii, user_data
@substrate: DBTable:todos

Capability: EU Privacy Safe (GDPR Right to Erasure & Portability)
  Quantifier: For ANY feature that stores Customer PII or user_data, provide 1-click full erasure and JSON export with zero stale reads.

  Scenario: 1-Click Right to Be Forgotten
    Given a user "alice@example.com" with active and recurring todo tasks
    When they trigger a GDPR account erasure request
    Then all tasks owned by "alice@example.com" in "DBTable:todos" are permanently wiped
    And any cached read projections for "alice@example.com" are immediately invalidated (0ms stale PII)
